  "ja40:2.1": "10. khadiraṅgārajātakaṃ. ",
  "ja40:2.2": "kulāvakavaggo catuttho. ",
  "ja40:3.1": "tassuddānaṃ: ",
  "ja40:4.1": "sirimātalidhītarapakkhivaro ratirāgatomātāpitā ",
  "ja40:4.2": "ca puna, ",
  "ja40:4.3": "jagatīruhavuddhasukakkaṭako ",
  "ja40:4.4": "tathā nandakapiṇḍavarena dasa. "
